s un fallo de CI? Un fallo de CI es un error que ocurre durante la ejecución de un flujo de trabajo de integración continua en GitHub Actions","fr":"Qu''est-ce qu''un échec de CI ? Un échec de CI est une erreur qui se produit lors de l''exécution d''un flux de travail d''intégration continue dans GitHub Actions","de":"Was ist ein CI-Fehler? Ein CI-Fehler ist ein Fehler, der während der Ausführung eines Continuous-Integration-Workflows in GitHub Actions auftritt","pt":"Falha de CI é uma funcionalidade que ajuda a identificar e corrigir erros em pipelines de integração contínua","ru":"Неисправность CI - это функция, которая помогает определить и исправить ошибки в конвейерах непрерывной интеграции","ar":"فشل CI هو وظيفة تساعد على تحديد وأرقام إصلاح أخطاء في أنابيب التكامل المستمر"},"features":{"en":["Loads context from .github/workflows/ci.yml and .github/workflows/security.yml files","Analyzes pipeline summaries from docs/ci.md to identify job and step issues","Applies repo-specific fixes based on workflow and pipeline configurations","Supports diagnosis of security-related CI failures","Utilizes xAI to maximize profits in portfolio and options management"],"zh":["加载工作流文件 (.github/workflows/ci.yml)","加载管道摘要文件 (docs/ci.md)","识别 job 和 step 失败","应用仓库特定修复","支持 GitHub Actions 的安全功能"],"ja":["ワークフロー ファイル (.github/workflows/ci.yml) を読み込む","パイプラインのサマリー ファイル (docs/ci.md) を読み込む","ジョブとステップの失敗を特定する","リポジトリ固有の修復を適用する","GitHub Actions のセキュリティ機能をサポートする"],"ko":["워크플로 파일 (.github/workflows/ci.yml) 로드","파이프라인 요약 파일 (docs/ci.md) 로드","작업 및 단계 실패 식별","저장소 특정 수정 적용","GitHub Actions의 보안 기능 지원"],"es":["Diagnóstico de fallos de CI en GitHub Actions","Análisis de archivos .github/workflows/ci.yml","Resolución de errores en el flujo de trabajo de CI","Uso de la documentación de CI en docs/ci.md","Aplicación de soluciones específicas del repositorio","Integración con xAI para maximizar los beneficios"],"fr":["Diagnostic des échecs de CI dans GitHub Actions","Analyse des fichiers .github/workflows/ci.yml","Résolution d''erreurs dans le flux de travail de CI","Utilisation de la documentation de CI dans docs/ci.md","Application de solutions spécifiques au référentiel","Intégration avec xAI pour maximiser les bénéfices"],"de":["Fehlerdiagnose von CI-Fehlern in GitHub Actions","Analyse von Dateien .github/workflows/ci.yml","Fehlerbehebung im CI-Workflow","Verwendung der CI-Dokumentation in docs/ci.md","Anwendung von Repository-spezifischen Lösungen","Integration mit xAI zur Maximierung der Vorteile"],"pt":["Carga de contexto imediata para entender o repositório","Leitura de arquivos de workflow e pipeline para identificar erros","Mapeamento de falhas para trabalhos e etapas específicas","Aplicação de soluções personalizadas para cada repositório","Uso de tecnologias como GitHub Actions e xAI para maximizar a eficiência"],"ru":["Немедленная загрузка контекста для понимания репозитория","Чтение файлов рабочего процесса и конвейера для определения ошибок","Сопоставление неисправностей с конкретными заданиями и шагами","Применение индивидуальных решений для каждого репозитория","Использование технологий như GitHub Actions и xAI для повышения эффективности"],"ar":["تحميل السياق الفوري لفهم المستودع","قراءة ملفات سير العمل والأنابيب لتحديد الأخطاء","تعيين الفشل إلى مهام وخطوات محددة","تطبيق حلول مخصصة لكل مستودع","استخدام технологيات مثل GitHub Actions وxAI لزيادة الكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ci-failure","ci-failure setup guide","github actions ci failure diagnosis","ci-failure alternative","ci-failure vs github actions","troubleshooting ci failures","ci failure analysis","github workflow file analysis"],"zh":["CI 故障诊断","GitHub Actions","持续集成","AI 技术","故障解决","CI 设置指南","AIエージェント","远程 CI 失败"],"ja":["CI 故障診断","GitHub Actions","継続的インテグレーション","AI 技術","失敗解決","CI 設定ガイド","AIエージェント","リモート CI 失敗"],"ko":["CI 실패 진단","GitHub Actions","지속적인 통합","AI 기술","실패 해결","CI 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","원격 CI 실패"],"es":["fallos de CI","GitHub Actions","diagnóstico de errores","resolución de fallos","integración continua","xAI","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","agitente de AI"],"fr":["échecs de CI","GitHub Actions","diagnostic d''erreurs","résolution d''échecs","intégration continue","xAI","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","agent d''AI"],"de":["CI-Fehler","GitHub Actions","Fehlerdiagnose","Fehlerbehebung","Continuous Integration","xAI","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","AI-Agent"],"pt":["falha de CI","diagnóstico de CI","correção de CI","integração contínua","GitHub Actions","xAI","pipeline de CI","workflow de CI"],"ru":["неисправность CI","диагностика CI","исправление CI","непрерывная интеграция","GitHub Actions","xAI","конвейер CI","рабочий процесс CI"],"ar":["فشل CI","تشخيص CI","أرقام إصلاح CI","التكامل المستمر","GitHub Actions","xAI","أنابيب CI","سير العمل CI"]}},"owner":"sperezintexas","repo":"fintech-app","repoPath":"sperezintexas/fintech-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ci-failure","description":"Diagnose GitHub Actions CI failures and suggest fixes. Use when the user reports CI failed, GitHub job failed, Actions failed, build failed on remote, upload artifact failed, or pastes a failure from the Actions tab.","bodyPreview":"# CI Failure Diagnosis\n\nWhen the user reports a **remote GitHub Actions / CI failure** (or pastes a failure from the Actions tab), apply this skill.\n\n## 1. Load Context First\n\nRead these files **immediately** to understand this repo’s CI:\n\n- **Workflow:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (and `.github/workflows/security.yml` if the failure mentions security)\n- **Pipeline summary:** `docs/ci.md`\n\nUse them to map the failure to a job and step and to apply repo-specific fixes.\n\n## 2. Identify Job and Ste","body":"# CI Failure Diagnosis\n\nWhen the user reports a **remote GitHub Actions / CI failure** (or pastes a failure from the Actions tab), apply this skill.\n\n## 1. Load Context First\n\nRead these files **immediately** to understand this repo’s CI:\n\n- **Workflow:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (and `.github/workflows/security.yml` if the failure mentions security)\n- **Pipeline summary:** `docs/ci.md`\n\nUse them to map the failure to a job and step and to apply repo-specific fixes.\n\n## 2. Identify Job and Step\n\nFrom the user’s message or pasted log, determine:\n\n- **Job name** (e.g. Lint, Type Check, Test, Build, Docker Build, Notify Slack)\n- **Step name** (e.g. \"Run ESLint\", \"Build application\", \"Upload build artifacts\")\n\nIf the user only pastes an error line (e.g. \"No files were found with the provided path: .next\"), infer the step from the message and the workflow.\n\n## 3. Map to Fix\n\n| Failure / Log | Job | Step | Action |\n|--------------|-----|------|--------|\n| ESLint error, file:line | Lint | Run ESLint | Fix the reported file/line; run `npm run lint` locally. |\n| Type error, tsc | Type Check | Run TypeScript compiler | Fix the type; run `npx tsc --noEmit` locally. |\n| Test failure, vitest | Test | Run tests | Fix test or app code; run `npm test` locally. |\n| Build error, Next.js, OOM | Build | Build application | Check \"Build application\" logs; confirm `NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=4096` in workflow; fix build error or increase memory. |\n| No files .next, upload artifact | Build | Build application / Upload | Build didn’t produce `.next`; check \"Build application\" step logs. Ensure workflow has List build output, \"Fail if build did not produce .next\", and conditional upload (see docs/ci.md). |\n| Docker build failed | Docker Build | Build Docker image | Check Dockerfile and build-args (MONGODB_URI, MONGODB_DB). |\n| Notify Slack / health | Notify Slack | — | Check Secrets (SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL) and Variables (APP_URL); see docs/ci.md and readme. |\n\n## 4. Respond\n\n1. **Say which job and step failed** (and link to workflow if helpful).\n2. **Give a short cause** (e.g. \"Build didn’t produce `.next`\" or \"ESLint error in `src/foo.ts`\").\n3. **Suggest a concrete fix** (workflow change, code change, or env/secret), using `docs/ci.md` and `.github/workflows/ci.yml` as the source of truth.\n4. If the user pasted only one line, **ask for the full job log** for the failing step if you need it to be precise (e.g. \"Paste the full ''Build application'' step log from the Build job\").\n\n## 5. Optional: Cursor Rule\n\nFor more detail on mapping failures and repo-specific CI, see `.cursor/rules/github-ci.mdc` (it aligns with this skill and docs/ci.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:48.526Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub-focused Agents needing advanced CI failure diagnosis capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级CI故障诊断能力的GitHub专注的Agent。","ja":"GitHubに焦点を当てたエージェントが高度なCI障害診断機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 CI 오류 진단 기능이 필요한 GitHub 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en GitHub que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de diagnóstico de fallos de CI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur GitHub nécessitant des capacités de diagnostic avancées de défaillance de CI.","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-fokussierte Agenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Fehlersuche bei CI-Fehlern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados no GitHub que precisam de capacidades avançadas de diagnóstico de falhas de CI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на GitHub, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности диагностики сбоев CI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على GitHub والذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتشخيص فشل CI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze workflow files and pipeline summaries, mapping failures to specific jobs and steps using GitHub Actions and CI pipeline data from .github/workflows/ci.yml and docs/ci.md files.","zh":"赋予代理分析工作流文件和管道摘要的能力，使用GitHub Actions和CI管道数据从.github/workflows/ci.yml和docs/ci.md文件中将故障映射到特定的作业和步骤。","ja":"GitHub ActionsおよびCIパイプラインデータから.github/workflows/ci.ymlおよびdocs/ci.mdファイルを使用して、エージェントがワークフロー ファイルおよびパイプラインのサマリーを分析し、障害を特定のジョブおよびステップにマッピングする機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 워크플로 파일과 파이프라인 요약을 분석하고 GitHub Actions 및 CI 파이프라인 데이터에서 .github/workflows/ci.yml 및 docs/ci.md 파일을 사용하여 오류를 특정 작업 및 단계에 매핑할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar archivos de flujo de trabajo y resúmenes de tuberías, asignando fallos a trabajos y pasos específicos mediante datos de GitHub Actions y tuberías de CI de los archivos .github/workflows/ci.yml y docs/ci.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les fichiers de workflow et les résumés de pipeline, en affectant les défaillances à des tâches et des étapes spécifiques en utilisant les données de GitHub Actions et de pipeline de CI à partir des fichiers .github/workflows/ci.yml et docs/ci.md.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Workflow-Dateien und Pipelineresümees zu analysieren und Fehler bestimmten Jobs und Schritten zuzuordnen, indem GitHub Actions- und CI-Pipelinedaten aus den Dateien .github/workflows/ci.yml und docs/ci.md verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar arquivos de fluxo de trabalho e resumos de pipeline, mapeando falhas para trabalhos e etapas específicas usando dados de GitHub Actions e pipeline de CI dos arquivos .github/workflows/ci.yml e docs/ci.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать файлы рабочих процессов и сводки трубопроводов, сопоставляя сбои с конкретными заданиями и шагами с помощью данных GitHub Actions и данных CI-пайплайна из файлов .github/workflows/ci.yml и docs/ci.md.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحليل ملفات سير العمل وملخصات الأنابيب، وربط الفشل بمهام وخطوات محددة باستخدام بيانات GitHub Actions وبيانات CI pipeline من الملفات .github/workflows/ci.yml و docs/ci.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Diagnosing remote GitHub Actions CI failures","Analyzing pipeline summaries for error identification","Applying repo-specific fixes based on workflow file analysis"],"zh":["诊断远程GitHub Actions CI故障","分析管道摘要以识别错误","根据工作流文件分析应用存储库特定修复"],"ja":["リモートGitHub Actions CI障害の診断","パイプラインサマリーの分析によるエラーの特定","ワークフロー ファイル分析に基づくリポジトリ固有の修正の適用"],"ko":["원격 GitHub Actions CI 오류 진단","파이프라인 요약 분석을 통한 오류 식별","워크플로 파일 분석을 기반으로 하는 저장소별 수정 적용"],"es":["Diagnosticar fallos de GitHub Actions CI remotos","Analizar resúmenes de tuberías para la identificación de errores","Aplicar soluciones específicas del repositorio en función del análisis de archivos de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Diagnostiquer les défaillances de GitHub Actions CI à distance","Analyser les résumés de pipeline pour l''identification des erreurs","Appliquer des correctifs spécifiques au référentiel en fonction de l''analyse des fichiers de workflow"],"de":["Fern-GitHub-Actions-CI-Fehler diagnostizieren","Pipelineresümees analysieren, um Fehler zu identifizieren","Repo-spezifische Lösungen anwenden, basierend auf der Analyse von Workflow-Dateien"],"pt":["Diagnosticar falhas de CI de GitHub Actions remotas","Analizar resumos de pipeline para identificação de erros","Aplicar soluções específicas do repositório com base na análise do arquivo de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Диагностика удаленных сбоев GitHub Actions CI","Анализ сводок трубопроводов для выявления ошибок","Применение исправлений, специфичных для репозитория, на основе анализа файла рабочего процесса"],"ar":["تشخيص فشل GitHub Actions CI عن بعد","تحليل ملخصات الأنابيب لتحديد الأخطاء","تطبيق إصلاحات محددة للمستودع على أساس تحليل ملف سير العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub repository files","Limited to GitHub Actions and CI pipelines","Needs .github/workflows/ci.yml and docs/ci.md files for analysis"],"zh":["需要访问GitHub存储库文件","仅限GitHub Actions和CI管道","需要.github/workflows/ci.yml和docs/ci.md文件进行分析"],"ja":["GitHubリポジトリ ファイルへのアクセスが必要","GitHub ActionsおよびCIパイプラインのみ","分析には.github/workflows/ci.ymlおよびdocs/ci.mdファイルが必要"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","GitHub Actions 및 CI 파이프라인만 해당됩니다.",".github/workflows/ci.yml 및 docs/ci.md 파일이 분석에 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de repositorio de GitHub","Limitado a GitHub Actions y tuberías de CI","Necesita archivos .github/workflows/ci.yml y docs/ci.md para el análisis"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de référentiel GitHub","Limité à GitHub Actions et aux pipelines de CI","Nécessite les fichiers .github/workflows/ci.yml et docs/ci.md pour l''analyse"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf GitHub-Repository-Dateien","Begrenzt auf GitHub Actions und CI-Pipelines","Benötigt Dateien .github/workflows/ci.yml und docs/ci.md für die Analyse"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos do repositório GitHub","Limitado a GitHub Actions e pipelines de CI","Necessita de arquivos .github/workflows/ci.yml e docs/ci.md para análise"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам репозитория GitHub","Ограничен GitHub Actions и CI-пайплайнами","Требует файлов .github/workflows/ci.yml и docs/ci.md для анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات المستودع GitHub","محدود بـ GitHub Actions وأنابيب CI","يتطلب ملفات .github/workflows/ci.yml و docs/ci.md للتحليل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4f588cf1db21a836e8b60ff91b6e0b90777d2235da223f1371dbbc7e20012f5a","qualityScore":26}');
