ue triage by finding and presenting open issues for efficient resolution.","zh":"triage-helper是一种AI工具，用于帮助Flutter开发者通过CLI高效解决问题","ja":"triage-helperは、AIエージェントであり、Flutter開発者がCLIを介して問題を効率的に解決するのを支援します","ko":"triage-helper는 AI 도구로, Flutter 개발자가 CLI를 통해 문제를 효율적으로 해결하도록 지원합니다","es":"triage-helper es una herramienta de ayuda para IntelliJ que utiliza GitHub para encontrar y priorizar problemas","fr":"triage-helper est un outil d''aide pour IntelliJ qui utilise GitHub pour trouver et prioriser les problèmes","de":"triage-helper ist ein Hilfe-Tool für IntelliJ, das GitHub nutzt, um Probleme zu finden und zu priorisieren","pt":"O Triage-Helper é uma ferramenta de auxílio para desenvolvedores Flutter que facilita a triagem de issues do GitHub","ru":"Triage-Helper - инструмент для разработчиков Flutter, который облегчает сортировку задач на GitHub","ar":"مساعد التriage هو أداة مساعدة للتنمية باللغة Flutter التي تسهل فرز المسائل على GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Finds latest open issues in the https://github.com/flutter/flutter-intellij/ repo without a priority label","Guides users to check their `github-mcp-server` setup or `gh auth status` for authentication issues","References `docs/Triaging.md` for detailed setup instructions","Presents issues one at a time to the user, including issue URL and other details","Considers the most recently updated issues first for efficient triage"],"zh":["直接从GitHub仓库中找到最新的未解决问题","提供详细的设置说明","支持CLI问题解决","根据问题更新时间排序","使用github-mcp-server和gh auth status进行认证"],"ja":["GitHubリポジトリから最新の未解決問題を直接見つける","設定の詳細な説明を提供する","CLIによる問題解決をサポートする","問題の更新時間に基づいてソートする","github-mcp-serverとgh auth statusを使用した認証"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소에서 최신의 미해결 문제를 직접 찾기","설정에 대한 자세한 설명을 제공","CLI를 통한 문제 해결 지원","문제 업데이트에 따른 정렬","github-mcp-server와 gh auth status를 사용한 인증"],"es":["Encuentra los problemas más recientes en el repositorio de GitHub","Prioriza problemas sin etiqueta de prioridad","Guía al usuario para solucionar problemas de autenticación","Presenta problemas uno a uno con URL y otros detalles","Utiliza la CLI para interactuar con el usuario"],"fr":["Trouve les problèmes les plus récents dans le référentiel GitHub","Priorise les problèmes sans étiquette de priorité","Guide l''utilisateur pour résoudre les problèmes d''authentification","Présente les problèmes un à un avec URL et autres détails","Utilise la CLI pour interagir avec l''utilisateur"],"de":["Findet die neuesten Probleme im GitHub-Repository","Priorisiert Probleme ohne Prioritätsetikett","Leitet den Benutzer bei der Lösung von Authentifizierungsproblemen an","Stellt Probleme einzeln mit URL und anderen Details dar","Nutzt die CLI, um mit dem Benutzer zu interagieren"],"pt":["Encontra as issues mais recentes sem prioridade no repositório do GitHub","Fornece orientação para resolver problemas de autenticação","Apresenta as issues uma a uma para o usuário com URL e outras informações","Considera as issues mais recentemente atualizadas primeiro","Integração com o plugin do IntelliJ para Flutter"],"ru":["Находит последние задачи без приоритета в репозитории GitHub","Предоставляет рекомендации по устранению проблем с аутентификацией","Показывает задачи одну за другой для пользователя с URL и другими сведениями","Учитывает задачи, обновленные最近","Интеграция с плагином для IntelliJ для Flutter"],"ar":["يجد أحدث المسائل بدون أولوية في مخزن GitHub","يوفر إرشادات لحل مشاكل المصادقة","يعرض المسائل واحدة تلو الأخرى للمستخدم مع URL ومعلومات أخرى","يعتبر المسائل التي تم تحديثها مؤخرًا أولاً","التكامل مع مكون إضافي للغة Flutter"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use triage-helper","triage-helper setup guide","triage-helper alternative","triage-helper vs GitHub issue manager","triage-helper install","what is triage-helper","triage-helper for IntelliJ","GitHub issue triage with triage-helper","triage-helper for Flutter developers"],"zh":["triage-helper","Flutter插件","CLI问题解决","GitHub仓库","AI工具","问题解决流程","github-mcp-server","gh auth status"],"ja":["triage-helper","Flutterプラグイン","CLI問題解決","GitHubリポジトリ","AIエージェント","問題解決プロセス","github-mcp-server","gh auth status"],"ko":["triage-helper","Flutter 플러그인","CLI 문제 해결","GitHub 저장소","AI 도구","문제 해결 프로세스","github-mcp-server","gh auth status"],"es":["triage-helper","plugin de Flutter","IntelliJ","GitHub","CLI","herramienta de ayuda","priorización de problemas","autenticación","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["triage-helper","plugin Flutter","IntelliJ","GitHub","CLI","outil d''aide","priorisation de problèmes","authentification","développement de logiciels"],"de":["triage-helper","Flutter-Plugin","IntelliJ","GitHub","CLI","Hilfe-Tool","Priorisierung von Problemen","Authentifizierung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Triage-Helper","plugin do IntelliJ para Flutter","triagem de issues do GitHub","autenticação GitHub","desenvolvimento Flutter","ferramentas de auxílio para desenvolvedores","GitHub issues","CLI","IntelliJ"],"ru":["Triage-Helper","плагин для IntelliJ для Flutter","сортировка задач на GitHub","аутентификация GitHub","разработка Flutter","инструменты для разработчиков","GitHub задачи","CLI","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["مساعد التriage","مكون إضافي للغة Flutter","فرز المسائل على GitHub","مصادقة GitHub","التنمية باللغة Flutter","أدوات مساعدة للتنمية","مسائل GitHub","CLI","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"flutter","repo":"flutter-intellij","repoPath":"flutter/flutter-intellij","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.562Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"triage-helper","description":"Assistance with triage of unprioritized issues. Use when the user asks for help with triage.","bodyPreview":"When a user asks for help in the CLI:\n- Find the latest open issues in the https://github.com/flutter/flutter-intellij/ repo that don''t have a priority label.\n- If you encounter authentication issues, guide the user to check their `github-mcp-server` setup or `gh auth status` depending on available tools.\n- Reference `docs/Triaging.md` for detailed setup instructions.\n- Consider the most recently updated issues first. Start presenting issues one at a time to the user, with the issue URL and othe","body":"When a user asks for help in the CLI:\n- Find the latest open issues in the https://github.com/flutter/flutter-intellij/ repo that don''t have a priority label.\n- If you encounter authentication issues, guide the user to check their `github-mcp-server` setup or `gh auth status` depending on available tools.\n- Reference `docs/Triaging.md` for detailed setup instructions.\n- Consider the most recently updated issues first. Start presenting issues one at a time to the user, with the issue URL and other relevant information.\n- For each issue, give suggestions such as:\n    - Close the issue if it''s not relevant anymore (e.g. it''s been fixed, the code it''s referencing is outdated, etc.)\n    - Suggest how to reproduce if it looks like it may be easy to reproduce locally\n    - Ask for a reproduction with a small project if reproduction may be hard locally\n    - Ask for more information and apply a waiting for response label\n    - Note a code pointer for the issue if it could be a good first issue for an external contributor\n    - Suggest a priority and other labels that may be relevant along with reasoning for the priority\n- Then wait for user feedback before continuing on to the next issue.\n\nAvoid executing tasks on GitHub directly, such as making comments, applying labels, or closing issues.\n\nThere is additional context on our issue triage process in docs/Triaging.md."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:37.003Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing GitHub issue triage and prioritization capabilities for Flutter and IntelliJ projects.","zh":"非常适合需要 GitHub vấn đề分類和優先順序功能的 CLI 代理，適用於 Flutter 和 IntelliJ 項目。","ja":"CLI エージェントが GitHub の問題を分類して優先順位を付ける機能が必要な場合に最適です。Flutter および IntelliJ プロジェクトに適用されます。","ko":"GitHub 이슈 분류 및 우선순위 지정 기능이 필요한 CLI 에이전트에 적합합니다. Flutter 및 IntelliJ 프로젝트에 적용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI que necesitan capacidades de clasificación y priorización de problemas de GitHub para proyectos de Flutter e IntelliJ.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI qui ont besoin de capacités de triage et de priorisation des problèmes GitHub pour les projets Flutter et IntelliJ.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-Agents, die GitHub-Issue-Triage- und Priorisierungsfunktionen für Flutter- und IntelliJ-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes CLI que necessitam de capacidades de triagem e priorização de problemas do GitHub para projetos Flutter e IntelliJ.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов CLI, которым необходимы возможности триажа и приоритизации проблем GitHub для проектов Flutter и IntelliJ.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء CLI الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности فرز وتحديد أولوية قضايا GitHub لمشاريع Flutter و IntelliJ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently triage GitHub issues using the GitHub API, handling authentication via `github-mcp-server` or `gh auth status`, and referencing detailed setup instructions from `docs/Triaging.md` to streamline issue management for developers working with Flutter and IntelliJ.","zh":"賦予代理人使用 GitHub API 效率地分類 GitHub 問題的能力，通過 `github-mcp-server` 或 `gh auth status` 處理身份驗證，並引用 `docs/Triaging.md` 中的詳細設置說明以簡化與 Flutter 和 IntelliJ 合作的開發人員的問題管理。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub API を使用して GitHub の問題を効率的に分類できるようにし、`github-mcp-server` または `gh auth status` を使用して認証を処理し、開発者が Flutter および IntelliJ で作業する際の問題管理を簡素化するために `docs/Triaging.md` からの詳細な設定手順を参照します。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub API를 사용하여 GitHub 이슈를 효율적으로 분류할 수 있도록 하며, `github-mcp-server` 또는 `gh auth status`를 통해 인증을 처리하며, Flutter 및 IntelliJ와 협력하는 개발자를 위한 이슈 관리를 간소화하기 위해 `docs/Triaging.md`의 자세한 설정 지침을 참조합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a triagear eficientemente los problemas de GitHub utilizando la API de GitHub, maneja la autenticación a través de `github-mcp-server` o `gh auth status` y hace referencia a las instrucciones de configuración detalladas de `docs/Triaging.md` para optimizar la gestión de problemas para los desarrolladores que trabajan con Flutter e IntelliJ.","fr":"Permet aux agents de trier efficacement les problèmes GitHub en utilisant l''API GitHub, gère l''authentification via `github-mcp-server` ou `gh auth status` et fait référence aux instructions de configuration détaillées de `docs/Triaging.md` pour rationaliser la gestion des problèmes pour les développeurs qui travaillent avec Flutter et IntelliJ.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, GitHub-Probleme effizient zu triageieren, indem sie die GitHub-API verwenden, Authentifizierung über `github-mcp-server` oder `gh auth status` handhaben und auf detaillierte Einrichtungsanweisungen in `docs/Triaging.md` verweisen, um die Problemverwaltung für Entwickler, die mit Flutter und IntelliJ arbeiten, zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita agentes a triar eficientemente problemas do GitHub usando a API do GitHub, lidando com autenticação via `github-mcp-server` ou `gh auth status`, e referenciando instruções de configuração detalhadas de `docs/Triaging.md` para otimizar a gestão de problemas para desenvolvedores que trabalham com Flutter e IntelliJ.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно триажировать проблемы GitHub с помощью API GitHub, обрабатывая аутентификацию через `github-mcp-server` или `gh auth status`, и ссылаясь на подробные инструкции по настройке из `docs/Triaging.md` для оптимизации управления проблемами для разработчиков, работающих с Flutter и IntelliJ.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من فرز قضايا GitHub بفعالية باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub، وت xử lý المصادقة عبر `github-mcp-server` أو `gh auth status`، والاطلاع على إرشادات الإعداد المفصلة من `docs/Triaging.md` لتحسين إدارة القضايا للمطورين الذين يعملون على Flutter و IntelliJ."},"useCases":{"en":["Triageing open issues in the Flutter IntelliJ repository","Guiding users through GitHub authentication setup using `github-mcp-server` or `gh auth status`","Presenting the most recently updated issues first for efficient prioritization"],"zh":["在 Flutter IntelliJ 存儲庫中分類開啟的問題","使用 `github-mcp-server` 或 `gh auth status` 導致用戶完成 GitHub 身份驗證設置","根據最近更新時間優先顯示問題，以實現高效的優先順序"],"ja":["Flutter IntelliJ リポジトリのオープン問題をトリアージする","`github-mcp-server` または `gh auth status` を使用して GitHub 認証の設定をユーザーに導く","問題を最新の更新時間に基づいて優先順位付けして表示することで効率的な優先順位を実現する"],"ko":["Flutter IntelliJ 저장소에서 열린 이슈를 분류합니다.","`github-mcp-server` 또는 `gh auth status`를 사용하여 사용자가 GitHub 인증 설정을 완료하도록 합니다.","최근 업데이트된 이슈를 먼저 표시하여 효율적인 우선순위를 제공합니다."],"es":["Triagear problemas abiertos en el repositorio Flutter IntelliJ","Guía a los usuarios a través de la configuración de autenticación de GitHub utilizando `github-mcp-server` o `gh auth status`","Presentar los problemas actualizados más recientemente primero para una priorización eficiente"],"fr":["Trier les problèmes ouverts dans le référentiel Flutter IntelliJ","Guider les utilisateurs à travers la configuration de l''authentification GitHub en utilisant `github-mcp-server` ou `gh auth status`","Présenter les problèmes mis à jour le plus récemment en premier pour une priorisation efficace"],"de":["Offene Probleme im Flutter-IntelliJ-Repository triageieren","Benutzer durch die GitHub-Authentifizierungseinrichtung mit `github-mcp-server` oder `gh auth status` führen","Die zuletzt aktualisierten Probleme zuerst anzeigen, um eine effiziente Priorisierung zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Triagem de problemas abertos no repositório Flutter IntelliJ","Orientação de usuários durante a configuração de autenticação do GitHub usando `github-mcp-server` ou `gh auth status`","Apresentação dos problemas atualizados mais recentemente primeiro para priorização eficiente"],"ru":["Триаж открытых проблем в репозитории Flutter IntelliJ","Помощь пользователям в настройке аутентификации GitHub с помощью `github-mcp-server` или `gh auth status`","Отображение наиболее недавно обновлённых проблем primero для эффективной приоритизации"],"ar":["فرز القضايا المفتوحة في مستودع Flutter IntelliJ","توجيه المستخدمين خلال إعداد المصادقة على GitHub باستخدام `github-mcp-server` أو `gh auth status`","عرض القضايا المحدثة最近 أولاً من أجل تحديد الأولويات بفعالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Limited to the Flutter IntelliJ repository","Dependent on user''s `github-mcp-server` setup or `gh auth status` for authentication"],"zh":["需要 GitHub API 存取","僅限於 Flutter IntelliJ 存儲庫","需要用戶的 `github-mcp-server` 設置或 `gh auth status` 進行身份驗證"],"ja":["GitHub API へのアクセスが必要","Flutter IntelliJ リポジトリに限定される","ユーザーの `github-mcp-server` 設定または `gh auth status` による認証が必要"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스가 필요합니다.","Flutter IntelliJ 저장소로 제한됩니다.","사용자의 `github-mcp-server` 설정 또는 `gh auth status`를 통해 인증이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GitHub","Limitado al repositorio Flutter IntelliJ","Dependiente de la configuración de `github-mcp-server` del usuario o de `gh auth status` para la autenticación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GitHub","Limité au référentiel Flutter IntelliJ","Dépendant de la configuration de `github-mcp-server` de l''utilisateur ou de `gh auth status` pour l''authentification"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf das Flutter-IntelliJ-Repository","Abhängig von der `github-mcp-server`-Konfiguration des Benutzers oder von `gh auth status` für die Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do GitHub","Limitado ao repositório Flutter IntelliJ","Dependente da configuração do `github-mcp-server` do usuário ou `gh auth status` para autenticação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API GitHub","Ограничен репозиторием Flutter IntelliJ","Зависит от настройки `github-mcp-server` пользователя или `gh auth status` для аутентификации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","محدود بمستودع Flutter IntelliJ","يعتمد على إعدادات `github-mcp-server` للمستخدم أو `gh auth status` للمصادقة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1e680800adb1a9e060dfd749d2652e3721183ff60afac59329e8ec01b70bf884","qualityScore":26}');
