INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('sf-bcca/Kith/kith-ux-polisher', 'kith-ux-polisher', 'sf-bcca', 'Kith', 'community', 'kith-ux-polisher sf-bcca Kith community The kith-ux-polisher skill enhances Kith''s user interface with a modern design system, benefiting developers and users alike. It provides a consistent visual identity through core aesthetics and interactable elements. Kith UX Polisher是一个现代的家族树应用，提供用户友好的设计系统 Kith UX Polisherはモダンなファミリーツリー・アプリケーションであり、ユーザーに優しい設計システムを提供します Kith UX Polisher는 현대적인 가계도 응용 프로그램으로 사용자 친화적인 디자인 시스템을 제공합니다 Kith UX Polisher es una herramienta de diseño de interfaz de usuario que utiliza rounded corners, sombras y glassmorphism para mejorar la experiencia del usuario Kith UX Polisher est un outil de conception d''interface utilisateur qui utilise des coins arrondis, des ombres et du glassmorphism pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur Kith UX Polisher ist ein Benutzeroberflächendesign-Tool, das gerundete Ecken, Schatten und Glassmorphismus verwendet, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern O Kith UX Polisher é uma ferramenta para melhorar a experiência do usuário em aplicações de árvore genealógica, com recursos como cantos arredondados e sombras suaves Kith UX Polisher - это инструмент для улучшения пользовательского опыта в приложениях семейного дерева, с функциями như закругленные углы и мягкие тени Kith UX Polisher هو أداة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم في تطبيقات الشجرة العائلية، مع ميزات مثل الزوايا المستديرة والظلال الناعمة how to use kith-ux-polisher kith-ux-polisher design system kith-ux-polisher alternative kith-ux-polisher setup guide kith-ux-polisher install what is kith-ux-polisher kith-ux-polisher vs other design systems kith-ux-polisher tutorial kith-ux-polisher best practices Kith UX Polisher 设计系统 用户体验 圆角设计 阴影效果 玻璃效果 交互设计 现代的家族树应用 AI工具 用户体验优化 Implements rounded corners using `rounded-3xl` and `rounded-2xl` classes Adds soft, colored shadows for depth using `shadow-lg` and `shadow-primary/20` Utilizes glassmorphism with `backdrop-blur-md` and semi-transparent backgrounds (`bg-white/80`) Defines core aesthetics for main containers, modals, cards, inputs, and buttons Enables interactable elements with consistent design patterns kith-ux-polisher is a skill that acts as the guardian of Kith''s visual identity and user experience, implementing a design system with rounded corners, shadows, and glassmorphism.');
