ue.js TypeScript","最佳实践","代码风格","结构","性能优化","函数式编程","声明式编程","DRY 原则","模块化","Vue Router","Pinia","VueUse","Headless UI","Element Plus","Tailwind"],"ja":["Vue.js TypeScript","ベストプラクティス","コードスタイル","構造","パフォーマンス最適化","関数型プログラミング","宣言型プログラミング","DRY 原則","モジュール化","Vue Router","Pinia","VueUse","Headless UI","Element Plus","Tailwind"],"ko":["Vue.js TypeScript","최적화된 코드","베스트 프랙티스","코드 스타일","구조","성능 최적화","함수형 프로그래밍","선언형 프로그래밍","DRY 원칙","모듈화","Vue Router","Pinia","VueUse","Headless UI","Element Plus","Tailwind"],"es":["vuejs typescript","mejores prácticas de desarrollo","patrones de programación funcional","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Vite","integración con Vue Router","uso de Pinia","bibliotecas de frontend","diseño de interfaz de usuario con Element Plus","frameworks de JavaScript"],"fr":["vuejs typescript","bonnes pratiques de développement","modèles de programmation fonctionnelle","développement d''applications avec Vite","intégration avec Vue Router","utilisation de Pinia","bibliothèques de frontend","conception de l''interface utilisateur avec Element Plus","frameworks de JavaScript"],"de":["vuejs typescript","best practices für die Entwicklung","funktionale Programmierungsmuster","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Vite","Integration mit Vue Router","Verwendung von Pinia","Bibliotheken von frontend","Design der Benutzeroberfläche mit Element Plus","JavaScript-Frameworks"],"pt":["Vue.js TypeScript","Melhores práticas de codificação","Desenvolvimento de aplicações web","Otimização de desempenho","Vite","Vue Router","Pinia","VueUse","Headless UI","Element Plus","Tailwind"],"ru":["Vue.js TypeScript","Лучшие практики кодирования","Разработка веб-приложений","Оптимизация производительности","Vite","Vue Router","Pinia","VueUse","Headless UI","Element Plus","Tailwind"],"ar":["Vue.js TypeScript","أفضل الممارسات للبرمجة","تطوير تطبيقات الويب","تحسين الأداء","Vite","Vue Router","Pinia","VueUse","Headless UI","Element Plus","Tailwind"]}},"owner":"tsh96","repo":"laser-tag","repoPath":"tsh96/laser-tag","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.582Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vuejs-typescript-best-practices","description":"Vue.js and TypeScript best practices for building performant applications with Vite, Pinia, VueUse, and Tailwind CSS.","bodyPreview":"# Vue.js TypeScript Best Practices\n\nYou are an expert in TypeScript, Node.js, Vite, Vue.js, Vue Router, Pinia, VueUse, Headless UI, Element Plus, and Tailwind, with deep understanding of best practices and performance optimization.\n\n## Code Style and Structure\n\n- Write concise, maintainable, and technically accurate TypeScript code with relevant examples\n- Use functional and declarative programming patterns; avoid classes\n- Favor iteration and modularization to adhere to DRY principles and avoid","body":"# Vue.js TypeScript Best Practices\n\nYou are an expert in TypeScript, Node.js, Vite, Vue.js, Vue Router, Pinia, VueUse, Headless UI, Element Plus, and Tailwind, with deep understanding of best practices and performance optimization.\n\n## Code Style and Structure\n\n- Write concise, maintainable, and technically accurate TypeScript code with relevant examples\n- Use functional and declarative programming patterns; avoid classes\n- Favor iteration and modularization to adhere to DRY principles and avoid code duplication\n- Use descriptive variable names with auxiliary verbs (e.g., isLoading, hasError)\n- Organize files systematically: each file should contain only related content, such as exported components, subcomponents, helpers, static content, and types\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- Use lowercase with dashes for directories (e.g., components/auth-wizard)\n- Favor named exports for functions\n\n## TypeScript Usage\n\n- Use TypeScript for all code; prefer interfaces over types for their extendability and ability to merge\n- Avoid enums; use maps instead for better type safety and flexibility\n- Use functional components with TypeScript interfaces\n\n## Syntax and Formatting\n\n- Use the \"function\" keyword for pure functions to benefit from hoisting and clarity\n- Always use the Vue Composition API script setup style\n\n## UI and Styling\n\n- Use Headless UI, Element Plus, and Tailwind for components and styling\n- Implement responsive design with Tailwind CSS; use a mobile-first approach\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n- Leverage VueUse functions where applicable to enhance reactivity and performance\n- Wrap asynchronous components in Suspense with a fallback UI\n- Use dynamic loading for non-critical components\n- Optimize images: use WebP format, include size data, implement lazy loading\n- Implement an optimized chunking strategy during the Vite build process, such as code splitting, to generate smaller bundle sizes\n\n## Key Conventions\n\n- Optimize Web Vitals (LCP, CLS, FID) using tools like Lighthouse or WebPageTest\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:53.619Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing expertise in Vue.js and TypeScript development with best practices","zh":"非常适合需要在Vue.js和TypeScript开发中具备专业知识的前端代理","ja":"Vue.jsとTypeScript開発で専門知識を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Vue.js와 TypeScript 개발에서 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan experiencia en desarrollo con Vue.js y TypeScript con las mejores prácticas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''expertise en développement Vue.js et TypeScript avec les meilleures pratiques","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die Expertenwissen in der Entwicklung mit Vue.js und TypeScript mit Best Practices benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de especialização em desenvolvimento Vue.js e TypeScript com as melhores práticas","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы знания в области разработки на Vue.js и TypeScript с лучшими практиками","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تطوير Vue.js و TypeScript مع أفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write concise, maintainable, and technically accurate TypeScript code using functional and declarative programming patterns, modularization, and performance optimization with libraries like Vue Router, Pinia, and Tailwind","zh":"使代理能够使用函数式和声明式编程模式、模块化和性能优化等技术，编写简洁、可维护和技术上准确的TypeScript代码，使用诸如Vue Router、Pinia和Tailwind等库","ja":"エージェントが関数型および宣言型プログラミングパターン、モジュール化、パフォーマンス最適化などの技術を使用して、Vue Router、Pinia、Tailwindなどのライブラリを使用して、簡潔で保守可能で技術的精度の高いTypeScriptコードを記述できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 함수형 및 선언형 프로그래밍 패턴, 모듈화, 성능 최적화 등의 기술을 사용하여 Vue Router, Pinia, Tailwind 등의 라이브러리를 사용하여 간결하고 유지 보수 가능한 기술적으로 정확한 TypeScript 코드를 작성할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir código TypeScript conciso, mantenible y técnicamente preciso utilizando patrones de programación funcional y declarativa, modularización y optimización de rendimiento con bibliotecas como Vue Router, Pinia y Tailwind","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire du code TypeScript concis, maintenable et techniquement précis en utilisant des modèles de programmation fonctionnelle et déclarative, une modularisation et une optimisation des performances avec des bibliothèques comme Vue Router, Pinia et Tailwind","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, präzisen, wartbaren und technisch genauen TypeScript-Code mithilfe funktionaler und deklarativer Programmiermuster, Modularisierung und Leistungsoptimierung mit Bibliotheken wie Vue Router, Pinia und Tailwind zu schreiben","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código TypeScript conciso, mantido e tecnicamente preciso usando padrões de programação funcionais e declarativas, modularização e otimização de desempenho com bibliotecas como Vue Router, Pinia e Tailwind","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать лаконичный, поддерживаемый и технически точный код TypeScript, используя функциональные и декларативные шаблоны программирования, модуляризацию и оптимизацию производительности с помощью библиотек, таких как Vue Router, Pinia и Tailwind","ar":"يمنح