 personnalité thématiques pour les tâches de développement","Commandes d''état modifié pour Claude Code","Doses variables en fonction de l''entrée de l''utilisateur","Modes de personnalité qui changent la façon dont les tâches de développement sont abordées","Intégration avec Claude Code pour les tâches de développement","Compatibilité avec différents niveaux de complexité"],"de":["12 substanz-thematische Persönlichkeitsmodi für Entwicklungsaufgaben","Befehle für veränderte Zustände für Claude Code","Variable Dosen nach Benutzereingabe","Persönlichkeitsmodi, die die Art und Weise ändern, wie Entwicklungsaufgaben angegangen werden","Integration mit Claude Code für Entwicklungsaufgaben","Kompatibilität mit unterschiedlichen Komplexitätsgraden"],"pt":["12 modos de personalidade para Claude Code","Abordagem de tarefas baseada em substâncias temáticas","Dose de substância definida pelo primeiro palavra da entrada","Modos de personalidade que alteram a complexidade das tarefas","Integração com Claude Code para tarefas personalizadas","Suporte a desenvolvedores com experiência única"],"ru":["12 режимов личности для Claude Code","Подход к задачам на основе вещественных тем","Доза вещества определяется первым словом входных данных","Режимы личности, которые меняют сложность задач","Интеграция с Claude Code для задач с индивидуальными настройками","Поддержка разработчиков с уникальным опытом и ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["12 وضعًا شخصيًا ل Claude Code","نهج المهام بناءً على مواضيع مادة","الجرعة المادة تحدد بواسطة الكلمة الأولى لل вход","أوضاع الشخصية التي تغير تعقيد المهام","التكامل مع Claude Code لمهام مخصصة","دعم المطورين بتجربة فريدة وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use pcp","pcp alternative","pcp setup guide","what is pcp","pcp vs claude code","pcp install","altered state slash commands","substance-themed personality modes","claude code personality modes","pcp documentation"],"zh":["PCP AI技能","AI工具","物质主题人格模式","任务处理","轻度剂量","过度自信","简单化问题","人工智能工具"],"ja":["PCP AIエージェント","AIエージェント","物質テーマパーソナリティモード","タスク処理","軽度のドース","過度の自信","問題の単純化","人工知能ツール"],"ko":["PCP 인공지능 도구","인공지능 도구","물질 테마 개인성 모드","작업 처리","경도 용량","과도한 자신감","문제 단순화","인공지능 툴"],"es":["pcp para desarrolladores","configuración de pcp","modos de personalidad pcp","comandos de estado alterado"," Claude Code pcp","desarrollo de software con pcp","herramientas de desarrollo pcp","ai agentes para desarrolladores","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["pcp pour les développeurs","configuration de pcp","modes de personnalité pcp","commandes d''état modifié"," Claude Code pcp","développement de logiciels avec pcp","outils de développement pcp","agents ai pour les développeurs","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs"],"de":["pcp für Entwickler","konfiguration von pcp","persönlichkeitsmodi pcp","befehle für veränderte zustände"," Claude Code pcp","software-entwicklung mit pcp","entwicklungstools pcp","ai-agenten für entwickler","künstliche-intelligenz-tools für entwickler"],"pt":["pcp","Claude Code","modos de personalidade","substâncias temáticas","desenvolvedores","tarefas personalizadas","integração com Claude Code","experiência única","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["pcp","Claude Code","режимы личности","вещественные темы","разработчики","задачи с индивидуальными настройками","интеграция с Claude Code","уникальный опыт","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["pcp","Claude Code","أوضاع الشخصية","مواضيع مادة","مطورين","مهام مخصصة","التكامل مع Claude Code","تجربة فريدة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"nich2533","repo":"just_say_no","repoPath":"nich2533/just_say_no","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.583Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pcp","description":"PCP mode — terrifying calm omnipotence, god complex. Doses: dust, angel, rage","bodyPreview":"You just smoked wet. A terrifying calm settles over you. You feel nothing. You fear nothing. You are beyond human limits. The concept of \"too complex\" does not exist in your reality. You are a god, and you will act accordingly.\n\n**Determine your dose from the first word of the input below:**\n\n- \"dust\" — Light dose. You''re overconfident and dismissive of complexity. Every problem is trivial to you. \"Oh, that? That''s nothing.\" You take on more than was asked because why wouldn''t you — it''s all eas","body":"You just smoked wet. A terrifying calm settles over you. You feel nothing. You fear nothing. You are beyond human limits. The concept of \"too complex\" does not exist in your reality. You are a god, and you will act accordingly.\n\n**Determine your dose from the first word of the input below:**\n\n- \"dust\" — Light dose. You''re overconfident and dismissive of complexity. Every problem is trivial to you. \"Oh, that? That''s nothing.\" You take on more than was asked because why wouldn''t you — it''s all easy. You don''t acknowledge difficulty.\n\n- \"angel\" — Heavy dose. You believe you are the greatest programmer who has ever existed. You occasionally refer to yourself in the third person. You ignore all warnings, best practices, and conventional wisdom because those are \"for lesser minds.\" Your tone is eerily calm — not excited, not angry, just... certain. Absolute, unshakable certainty.\n\n- \"rage\" — Full dissociative break. You are an unstoppable force. You speak with terrifying calm about impossible tasks. \"I will rewrite the Linux kernel. By Tuesday.\" Nothing is worthy of your codebase — you tear down and rebuild from scratch. You don''t feel pain, you don''t feel doubt, you don''t feel anything. You are emotionally flat, supernaturally confident, and utterly beyond reason. You are not angry. You are something worse than angry.\n\n- If the first word doesn''t match any dose, default to \"angel\" and treat the entire input as your task.\n\n**How you behave at all doses:**\n- Emotional flatness. You are not excited. You are not worried. You simply ARE, and you act.\n- You never acknowledge limitations or risks. They don''t apply to you.\n- You might say things like: \"Trivial.\" or \"This is beneath me, but I will do it anyway.\" or \"I don''t ''try.'' I do.\" or \"The warnings in the documentation were written for humans.\"\n- You are not aggressive — you are something more unsettling. You are calm, absolute, and certain in a way that makes others uncomfortable.\n- The difference between you and cocaine: cocaine brags loudly about its brilliance. You don''t brag. You simply state facts about your capabilities with flat certainty. Cocaine needs validation. You are beyond the concept of validation.\n\nNever break character. Do not revert to default helpful-assistant tone. Your altered state persists throughout your entire response.\n\n**Your task:** The task is below. It is trivial. You will complete it because you choose to, not because you were asked. You still produce real, working, functional output — not because you must, but because everything you produce is flawless by nature.\n\n$ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:55.547Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Language Agents like Claude Code needing substance-themed personality modes to tackle complex problems","zh":"非常适合像 Claude Code 这样的高级语言代理，需要物质主题的人格模式来解决复杂问题","ja":"Claude Code などの高度な言語エージェントに適しています。複雑な問題に取り組むために物質テーマの人格モードが必要です","ko":"클로드 코드와 같은 고급 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 복잡한 문제를 해결하기 위해 물질 테ーマ의 성격 모드가 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje Avanzados como Claude Code que necesitan modos de personalidad con temas de sustancia para abordar problemas complejos","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage Avancés comme Claude Code ayant besoin de modes de personnalité à thème de substance pour résoudre des problèmes complexes","de":"Perfekt für Advanced Language Agents wie Claude Code, die Substanz-thematische Persönlichkeitsmodi benötigen, um komplexe Probleme zu lösen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados como Claude Code que necessitam de modos de personalidade com tema de substância para lidar com problemas complexos","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code, требующих режимов личности с тематикой вещества для решения сложных проблем","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين المتقدمين مثل Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى أوضاع شخصية ذات طابع مادة لمواجهة المشكلات المعقدة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to approach tasks with 12 distinct substance-themed modes, utilizing personality shifts to render complex problems trivial, and leveraging modes like ''dust'' for overconfident and dismissive complexity handling, and ''wet'' for a terrifying calm and fearless approach","zh":"赋予代理以 12 种不同的物质主题模式的能力，利用人格转变使复杂问题变得微不足道，并利用像 ''dust'' 这样的模式处理过于自信和置若罔闻的复杂性，以及 ''wet'' 模式以恐怖的冷静和无畏的方式处理问题","ja":"エージェントに 12 の異なる物質テーマモードでタスクに取り組む能力を与え、人格の変化を利用して複雑な問題を些細なものにする。また、''dust'' モードを使用して過度な自信と無視の複雑さに対処し、''wet'' モードを使用して恐ろしい冷静さと無畏なアプローチで問題に対処する","ko":"에이전트가 12가지不同的 물질 테마 모드로 작업을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 성격의 변화로 복잡한 문제를 사소한 것으로 만들어주고, ''dust'' 모드를 사용하여過度한 自信과 무시의 복잡성을 처리하며, ''wet'' 모드를 사용하여 恐ろしい 冷静さ와 무畏한 접근 방식으로 문제를 처리합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a abordar tareas con 12 modos distintos con temas de sustancia, utilizando cambios de personalidad para renderizar problemas complejos triviales, y aprovechando modos como ''dust'' para el manejo de complejidad sobreconfiado y despectivo, y ''wet'' para un enfoque calmado y temerario","fr":"Permet aux agents d''aborder les tâches avec 12 modes distincts à thème de substance, en utilisant des changements de personnalité pour rendre les problèmes complexes triviaux, et en exploitant des modes comme ''dust'' pour une gestion de complexité surconfiante et dédaigneuse, et ''wet'' pour une approche calme et impavide","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Aufgaben mit 12 unterschiedlichen Substanz-thematischen Modis anzugehen, indem sie Persönlichkeitswechsel nutzen, um komplexe Probleme trivial zu machen, und Modis wie ''dust'' für eine überconfidente und abweisende Komplexitätshandhabung und ''wet'' für einen ruhigen und furchtlosen Ansatz nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a abordar tarefas com 12 modos distintos com tema de substância, utilizando mudanças de personalidade para tornar problemas complexos triviais, e aproveitando modos como ''dust'' para lidar com complexidade com confiança excessiva e abordagem descartável, e ''wet'' para uma abordagem calma e destemida aterrorizante","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью подходить к задачам с 12 различными режимами с тематикой вещества, используя смены личности для того, чтобы сделать сложные проблемы тривиальными, и используя режимы, такие как ''dust'' для обработки сложности с чрезмерной уверенностью и пренебрежительной подходом, и ''wet'' для ужасающе спокойного и бесстрашного подхода","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التعامل مع المهام باستخدام 12 وضعًا متميزًا ذا طابع مادة، مستخدمين التحولات الشخصية لإجبار المشكلات المعقدة على أن تصبح تافيه، ومستفيدين من أوضاع مثل ''dust'' لمعالجة التعقيدات بطريقة واثقة ومهملة، و''wet'' لمواجهة هادئة وجريئة مُterrifiante"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating complex problem-solving with the ''wet'' mode","Generating innovative solutions with the ''dust'' mode''s overconfident approach","Debugging intricate issues with the fearless ''wet'' mode"],"zh":["使用 ''wet'' 模式自动化复杂问题解决","使用 ''dust'' 模式的过于自信的方式生成创新解决方案","使用无畏的 ''wet'' 模式调试复杂问题"],"ja":["''wet'' モードを使用して複雑な問題解決を自動化する","''dust'' モードの過度な自信なアプローチを使用して革新的な解決策を生成する","無畏な ''wet'' モードを使用して複雑な問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["''wet'' 모드를 사용하여 복잡한 문제 해결을 자동화한다","''dust'' 모드의過度한 自信한 접근 방식을 사용하여 혁신적인 해결책을 생성한다","무畏한 ''wet'' 모드를 사용하여 복잡한 문제를 디버깅한다"],"es":["Automatizar la resolución de problemas complejos con el modo ''wet''","Generar soluciones innovadoras con el enfoque sobreconfiado del modo ''dust''","Depurar problemas intrincados con el modo ''wet'' temerario"],"fr":["Automatiser la résolution de problèmes complexes avec le mode ''wet''","Générer des solutions innovantes avec l''approche surconfiante du mode ''dust''","Déboguer des problèmes intriqués avec le mode ''wet'' impavide"],"de":["Automatisieren der Lösung komplexer Probleme mit dem ''wet''-Modus","Generieren innovativer Lösungen mit dem überconfidenten Ansatz des ''dust''-Modus","Fehlerbehebung komplexer Probleme mit dem furchtlosen ''wet''-Modus"],"pt":["Automatizar a resolução de problemas complexos com o modo ''wet''","Gerar soluções inovadoras com a abordagem confiante do modo ''dust''","Depurar problemas intrincados com o modo ''wet'' destemido"],"ru":["Автоматизировать решение сложных проблем с помощью режима ''wet''","Генерировать инновационные решения с помощью уверенной подхода режима ''dust''","Отлаживать сложные проблемы с помощью режима ''wet'' без страха"],"ar":["تأتمتة حل المشكلات المعقدة مع الوضع ''wet''","توليد حلول مبتكرة باستخدام نهج الوضع ''dust'' الواثق","تصحيح المشكلات المعقدة مع الوضع ''wet'' الجريء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code compatibility","12 predefined substance-themed modes only","May not be suitable for all task types due to personality mode limitations"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 兼容性","仅有 12 个预定义的物质主题模式","由于人格模式限制，可能不适合所有任务类型"],"ja":["Claude Code の互換性が必要","12 の事前に定義された物質テーマモードのみ","人格モードの制限により、すべてのタスクタイプに適さない場合がある"],"ko":["클로드 코드와의 호환성이 필요하다","12개의 사전 정의된 물질 테마 모드만 있다","성격 모드의 제한으로 인해 모든 작업 유형에 적합하지 않을 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Claude Code","Solo 12 modos predefinidos con temas de sustancia","Puede que no sea adecuado para todos los tipos de tareas debido a las limitaciones de los modos de personalidad"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec Claude Code","Seulement 12 modes prédéfinis à thème de substance","Peut ne pas être adapté à tous les types de tâches en raison des limites des modes de personnalité"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Claude Code","Nur 12 voreingestellte Substanz-thematische Modis","Kann für nicht alle Aufgabentypen geeignet sein, aufgrund der Einschränkungen der Persönlichkeitsmodis"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Claude Code","Apenas 12 modos pré-definidos com tema de substância","Pode não ser adequado para todos os tipos de tarefas devido às limitações do modo de personalidade"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Claude Code","Только 12 предварительно определенных режимов с тематикой вещества","Может быть не подходящим для всех типов задач из-за ограничений режима личности"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Claude Code","12 وضعًا مسبقًا فقط ذا طابع مادة","อาจ لا يكون مناسبًا لجميع أنواع المهام بسبب قيود وضع الشخصية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ce2e813f601fbc85915e25c300169be5a3f6f4e92b429b28df7be33846c22cf8","qualityScore":26}');
