INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('KurzaCationer/osrs-cache/archivist-retriever', 'archivist-retriever', 'KurzaCationer', 'osrs-cache', 'community', 'archivist-retriever KurzaCationer osrs-cache community Archivist-Retriever is a skill that prioritizes local documentation for technical queries, benefiting developers working with libraries, tools, and technical concepts. It ensures efficient resolution of tasks involving TanStack Router and PandaCSS. Archivist Retriever 是一种优先本地文档的技术查询工具，用于提高开发效率 Archivist Retriever は、ローカル文書を優先する技術検索ツールです Archivist Retriever는 로컬 문서를 우선하는 기술 질의 도구입니다 El agente archivist-retriever prioriza la documentación local sobre el conocimiento interno para cada consulta técnica, permitiendo a los desarrolladores acceder a información precisa y actualizada L''agent archivist-retriever donne la priorité à la documentation locale par rapport aux connaissances internes pour chaque requête technique, permettant aux développeurs d''accéder à des informations précises et à jour Der archivist-retriever-Agent priorisiert die lokale Dokumentation gegenüber dem internen Wissen für jede technische Anfrage, sodass Entwickler auf präzise und aktuelle Informationen zugreifen können O Archivist Retriever é uma ferramenta que prioriza a documentação local em projetos de desenvolvimento de software, garantindo que os desenvolvedores acessem informações precisas e atualizadas. ИИ Агент Archivist Retriever - это инструмент, который отдает приоритет локальной документации в проектах разработки программного обеспечения, обеспечивая доступ разработчиков к точной и актуальной информации. وكيل أرشيفي استرجاعي هو أداة تُفضل الوثائق المحلية في مشاريع تطوير البرمجيات، مما يضمن وصول المطورين إلى المعلومات الدقيقة والمحدّثة. how to use archivist-retriever what is archivist-retriever archivist-retriever alternative archivist-retriever vs internal knowledge archivist-retriever setup guide archivist-retriever library-first approach technical query resolution with archivist-retriever prioritizing local documentation with archivist-retriever archivist-retriever for TanStack Router archivist-retriever for PandaCSS Archivist Retriever 技术查询工具 本地文档优先 开发效率 TanStack Router 技术概念查询 库查询 AIエージェント Checks ./reference-material/docs for information before relying on internal knowledge Supports tasks involving libraries and tools like PandaCSS Resolves direct questions about project tech stack components like TanStack Router Prioritizes local documentation for efficient technical query resolution Enables accurate information retrieval for technical concepts Facilitates implementation of technical concepts within the project''s tech stack Archivist-Retriever is a technical query resolution skill that prioritizes local documentation over internal knowledge, ensuring accurate and efficient information retrieval.');
