ية رالف ويغوم، بما في ذلك اختيار السياق الذكي والتحقق من المهام"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"ralph-cycle: Development Cycle Automation for AI Agents","zh":"Ralph-Cycle AI工具设置指南","ja":"Ralph-Cycle AIエージェントのベストプラクティス","ko":"Ralph-Cycle AI 도구 구현 가이드","es":"Guía de Configuración de ralph-cycle: Ciclo de Desarrollo...","fr":"Guide de Configuration de ralph-cycle: Cycle de Développe...","de":"Konfigurationsleitfaden für ralph-cycle: Intelligenter En...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do ralph-cycle: Implementação de Cic...","ru":"Настройка ralph-cycle: Руководство по внедрению цикла раз...","ar":"دليل إعداد ralph-cycle: تنفيذ دورة التطوير مع أدوات الذكا..."},"description":{"en":"Streamline your development process with ralph-cycle. Learn how to automate your development cycle and improve efficiency - get started now!","zh":"了解Ralph-Cycle AI工具的技术细节和实施步骤，优化开发周期","ja":"Ralph-Cycle AIエージェントの機能と設定方法を紹介します","ko":"Ralph-Cycle AI 도구의 기능과 구현 방법을 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a configurar y utilizar ralph-cycle, una herramienta de desarrollo basada en la metodología Ralph Wiggum para mejorar tu productividad","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer et utiliser ralph-cycle, un outil de développement basé sur la méthodologie Ralph Wiggum pour améliorer votre productivité","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ralph-cycle konfigurieren und verwenden, ein Entwicklungstool basierend auf der Ralph-Wiggum-Methode, um Ihre Produktivität zu steigern","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o ralph-cycle para executar um ciclo de desenvolvimento eficaz, incluindo seleção de contexto inteligente e verificação de tarefas","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить ralph-cycle для выполнения цикла разработки, включая умный выбор контекста и проверку задач с помощью ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد ralph-cycle لتنفيذ دورة تطوير فعالة، بما في ذلك اختيار السياق الذكي والتحقق من المهام مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"ralph-cycle is a development cycle automation skill that executes a single cycle of task implementation, verification, and commit using the Ralph Wiggum Methodology.","zh":"Ralph-Cycle是一种AI工具，通过执行单一开发周期来实现开发流程的优化","ja":"Ralph-CycleはAIエージェントの一種で、開発サイクルを実行して開発プロセスを最適化します","ko":"Ralph-Cycle은 AI 도구의 일종으로, 단일 개발 사이클을 실행하여 개발 프로세스를 최적화합니다","es":"ralph-cycle es una herramienta de desarrollo que automatiza el ciclo de desarrollo siguiendo la metodología Ralph Wiggum","fr":"ralph-cycle est un outil de développement qui automatise le cycle de développement en suivant la méthodologie Ralph Wiggum","de":"ralph-cycle ist ein Entwicklungstool, das den Entwicklungszyklus automatisiert, indem es die Ralph-Wiggum-Methode befolgt","pt":"O ralph-cycle é uma habilidade de desenvolvimento que executa um ciclo de desenvolvimento com seleção de contexto inteligente e verificação de tarefas","ru":"Ralph-cycle - это навык разработки, который выполняет цикл разработки с умным выбором контекста и проверкой задач","ar":"ralph-cycle هو مهارة تطوير تنفذ دورة تطوير مع اختيار السياق الذكي والتحقق من المهام"},"features":{"en":["Reads prd.json and progress.md to determine the most logical next step","Analyzes backlog using the Ralph Wiggum Methodology","Executes a single development cycle with task implementation, verification, and commit","Requires .windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md for technical stack configuration","Utilizes selection logic to choose the next task"],"zh":["智能上下文选择","任务实现和验证","代码提交和管理","prd.json和progress.md文件分析","技术栈规则定义"],"ja":["スマートなコンテキスト選択","タスク実装と検証","コードのコミットと管理","prd.jsonとprogress.mdファイルの分析","テクノロジースタックの定義"],"ko":["스마트 컨텍스트 선택","태스크 구현과 검증","코드 커밋과 관리","prd.json과 progress.md 파일 분석","테크놀로지 스택 정의"],"es":["Análisis de backlog en prd.json","Determinación del siguiente paso lógico","Implementación de tareas basadas en la metodología Ralph Wiggum","Verificación y compromiso de cambios","Integración con tecnologías como JSON y Markdown"],"fr":["Analyse de la liste de tâches en prd.json","Détermination de l''étape logique suivante","Implémentation de tâches basées sur la méthodologie Ralph Wiggum","Vérification et engagement des modifications","Intégration avec des technologies comme JSON et Markdown"],"de":["Analyse der Aufgabenliste in prd.json","Bestimmung des nächsten logischen Schritts","Implementierung von Aufgaben basierend auf der Ralph-Wiggum-Methode","Überprüfung und Commit von Änderungen","Integration mit Technologien wie JSON und Markdown"],"pt":["Execução de ciclo de desenvolvimento com Metodologia Ralph Wiggum","Seleção de contexto inteligente com base em backlog","Verificação de tarefas e commit automático","Requisitos de pré-configuração, incluindo prd.json e progress.md","Integração com regras de tech-stack em .windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md"],"ru":["Выполнение цикла разработки в соответствии с Методологией Ральфа Виггума","Умный выбор контекста на основе бэклога","Проверка задач и автоматический коммит","Требования предварительной настройки, включая prd.json и progress.md","Интеграция с правилами tech-stack в .windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md"],"ar":["تنفيذ دورة تطوير مع منهجية رالف ويغوم","اختيار السياق الذكي على أساس قائمة الانتظار","التحقق من المهام والالتزام التلقائي","متطلبات الإعداد المسبق، بما في ذلك prd.json و progress.md","الدمج مع قواعد tech-stack في .windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ralph-cycle","ralph-cycle alternative","ralph-cycle setup guide","what is ralph-cycle","ralph-cycle vs agile methodology","ralph-cycle install","ralph-cycle development cycle automation"],"zh":["Ralph-Cycle","AI工具","开发周期","智能上下文选择","任务实现","代码提交","prd.json","progress.md"],"ja":["Ralph-Cycle","AIエージェント","開発サイクル","スマートなコンテキスト選択","タスク実装","コードのコミット","prd.json","progress.md"],"ko":["Ralph-Cycle","AI 도구","개발 사이클","스마트 컨텍스트 선택","태스크 구현","코드 커밋","prd.json","progress.md"],"es":["ralph-cycle","metodología Ralph Wiggum","desarrollo inteligente","herramientas de desarrollo","productividad en desarrollo","prd.json","progress.md","JSON","Markdown"],"fr":["ralph-cycle","méthodologie Ralph Wiggum","développement intelligente","outils de développement","productivité en développement","prd.json","progress.md","JSON","Markdown"],"de":["ralph-cycle","Ralph-Wiggum-Methode","intelligenter Entwicklungszyklus","Entwicklungstools","Produktivität in der Entwicklung","prd.json","progress.md","JSON","Markdown"],"pt":["ralph-cycle","ciclo de desenvolvimento","Metodologia Ralph Wiggum","seleção de contexto inteligente","verificação de tarefas","commit automático","prd.json","progress.md","tech-stack"],"ru":["ralph-cycle","цикл разработки","Методология Ральфа Виггума","умный выбор контекста","проверка задач","автоматический коммит","prd.json","progress.md","tech-stack","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["ralph-cycle","دورة تطوير","منهجية رالف ويغوم","اختيار السياق الذكي","التحقق من المهام","الالتزام التلقائي","prd.json","progress.md","tech-stack","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"davisschenk","repo":"tilt-hydrometer-web","repoPath":"davisschenk/tilt-hydrometer-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.636Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-cycle","description":"Execute a single Ralph development cycle by selecting a failing task, implementing it, verifying with tests, and committing. Use when ready to implement the next feature from the backlog.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Development Cycle\n\nThis skill executes a single development cycle following the Ralph Wiggum Methodology: pick one task, implement it, verify it, commit it.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting a cycle:\n\n- ✅ `prd.json` exists with backlog\n- ✅ `progress.md` exists\n- ✅ `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` exists\n\n## Cycle Steps\n\n### Step 1: Smart Context Selection\n\nRead `prd.json` and `progress.md`. Analyze the backlog to determine the most logical next step.\n\n**Selection Logic:** Do not simply p","body":"# Ralph Development Cycle\n\nThis skill executes a single development cycle following the Ralph Wiggum Methodology: pick one task, implement it, verify it, commit it.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting a cycle:\n\n- ✅ `prd.json` exists with backlog\n- ✅ `progress.md` exists\n- ✅ `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` exists\n\n## Cycle Steps\n\n### Step 1: Smart Context Selection\n\nRead `prd.json` and `progress.md`. Analyze the backlog to determine the most logical next step.\n\n**Selection Logic:** Do not simply pick the first item. Select the task that:\n\n- Is currently failing (`passes: false`)\n- Is unblocked by other tasks (dependencies are met)\n- Makes the most sense to implement given the current state of the code\n\n**Announce:** \"I have selected [task name] because [reason].\"\n\n**Constraint:** PICK ONLY ONE TASK AT A TIME! Do not skip tasks unless blocked. If blocked, document the blocking reason in `progress.md`.\n\n### Step 2: Planning & Journaling\n\nAppend a new entry to `progress.md` with the header \"## Working on [Task Name]\"\n\nWrite a brief plan of execution in the log including:\n\n- What files will be modified/created\n- What approach you''ll take\n- Any potential challenges\n- How you''ll verify completion\n\n**Constraint:** Do not modify code yet.\n\n### Step 3: Implementation\n\nImplement the feature described in the selected task using the smallest change that satisfies the acceptance criteria.\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n- Work ONLY on this specific task\n- Do not refactor unrelated code\n- Modify only files required for the selected task\n- Adhere to the standards in `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`\n- Follow the acceptance criteria from `prd.json`\n\n### Step 4: Verification\n\nExecute the verification command (e.g., `npm test`, `pytest`, etc.) relevant to this task.\n\nReference `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` for the correct verification commands. If it does not list any, infer minimal verification and document it in `progress.md`.\n\n**Retry Logic:**\n\nIf the command fails:\n\n1. Read the error output\n2. Attempt to fix the code\n3. Re-run verification\n4. Repeat up to 3 times\n\nIf it still fails after 3 tries, document the failure and next hypothesis in `progress.md`, then stop.\n\n### Step 5: Completion & Commit\n\nIf verification passes:\n\n1. Update `prd.json`: set `passes` to `true` for this task\n2. Update `progress.md`: Append \"**Result:** Success\"\n3. Run `git add .`\n4. Run `git commit --no-gpg-sign -m \"feat: [task description]\"`\n\n## Supporting Resources\n\nReference these files for guidance:\n\n- `cycle-checklist.md` - Quick reference checklist\n- `verification-examples.md` - Common verification patterns\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ Do not work on multiple tasks simultaneously\n❌ Do not mark task as passing without running verification\n❌ Do not commit code that fails tests\n❌ Do not refactor unrelated code during implementation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:38.185Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined task implementation and verification, particularly those utilizing the Ralph Wiggum Methodology.","zh":"非常适合需要简化任务实现和验证的开发代理，特别是那些使用Ralph Wiggum Methodology的代理。","ja":"Ralph Wiggum Methodologyを使用する開発エージェントがタスクの実装と検証を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"Ralph Wiggum Methodology를 사용하는 개발 에이전트가 작업 구현 및 검증을 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una implementación y verificación de tareas simplificadas, especialmente aquellos que utilizan la Metodología Ralph Wiggum.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''une mise en œuvre et de vérification de tâches rationalisées, en particulier ceux qui utilisent la Méthodologie Ralph Wiggum.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine rationalisierte Aufgabenimplementierung und -verifizierung benötigen, insbesondere solche, die die Ralph-Wiggum-Methode verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de implementação e verificação de tarefas otimizadas, particularmente aqueles que utilizam a Metodologia Ralph Wiggum.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима оптимизированная реализация и проверка задач, особенно тех, кто использует Методологию Ральфа Виггума.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ و 驗證 للمهام المُنسّقة، خاصةً أولئك الذين يستخدمون منهجية رالف وِگّوم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate development cycles by reading `prd.json` and `progress.md`, analyzing backlogs, and executing tasks based on the Ralph Wiggum Methodology, utilizing files like `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` for informed decision-making.","zh":"使代理能够通过读取`prd.json`和`progress.md`、分析积压并根据Ralph Wiggum Methodology执行任务来自动化开发周期，利用`.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`等文件进行明智的决策。","ja":"エージェントが`prd.json`と`progress.md`を読み、バックログを分析し、Ralph Wiggum Methodologyに基づいてタスクを実行することで、開発サイクルを自動化することができます。`.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`などのファイルを使用して、情報に基づいた決定を下すことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 `prd.json` 및 `progress.md`를 읽고 백로그를 분석하고 Ralph Wiggum Methodology에 따라 태스크를 실행하여 개발 주기를 자동화할 수 있습니다. `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하여 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 내릴 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar los ciclos de desarrollo leyendo `prd.json` y `progress.md`, analizando los atrasos y ejecutando tareas basadas en la Metodología Ralph Wiggum, utilizando archivos como `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les cycles de développement en lisant `prd.json` et `progress.md`, en analysant les retards et en exécutant des tâches basées sur la Méthodologie Ralph Wiggum, en utilisant des fichiers tels que `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Mitteln, Entwicklungszyklen zu automatisieren, indem sie `prd.json` und `progress.md` lesen, Rückstände analysieren und Aufgaben basierend auf der Ralph-Wiggum-Methode ausführen, wobei Dateien wie `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` für fundierte Entscheidungen verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar ciclos de desenvolvimento lendo `prd.json` e `progress.md`, analisando backlogs e executando tarefas com base na Metodologia Ralph Wiggum, utilizando arquivos como `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать циклы разработки, читая `prd.json` и `progress.md`, анализируя бэклоги и выполняя задачи на основе Методологии Ральфа Виггума, используя файлы типа `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من تطبيع دورات التطوير من خلال قراءة `prd.json` و `progress.md` و تحليل الردف و تنفيذ المهام بالاعتماد على منهجية رالف وِگّوم، باستخدام الملفات مثل `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` لأخذ القرارات المُستنيرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating single development cycles following the Ralph Wiggum Methodology","Implementing and verifying tasks based on backlog analysis from `prd.json`","Committing tasks after successful verification, streamlining the development process"],"zh":["按照Ralph Wiggum Methodology自动化单个开发周期","根据`prd.json`的积压分析实现和验证任务","在验证成功后提交任务，简化开发流程"],"ja":["Ralph Wiggum Methodologyに基づいて単一の開発サイクルを自動化する","`prd.json`のバックログ分析に基づいてタスクを実装して検証する","検証に成功した後タスクをコミットし、開発プロセスを簡素化する"],"ko":["Ralph Wiggum Methodology에 따라 단일 개발 주기를 자동화하는 것","`prd.json`의 백로그 분석을 기반으로 태스크를 구현하고 검증하는 것","검증에 성공한 후 태스크를 커밋하여 개발 프로세스를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar ciclos de desarrollo únicos siguiendo la Metodología Ralph Wiggum","Implementar y verificar tareas basadas en el análisis de atrasos desde `prd.json`","Confirmar tareas después de una verificación exitosa, racionalizando el proceso de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatiser des cycles de développement uniques en suivant la Méthodologie Ralph Wiggum","Mettre en œuvre et vérifier des tâches basées sur l''analyse des retards à partir de `prd.json`","Valider des tâches après une vérification réussie, rationalisant le processus de développement"],"de":["Automatisieren einzelner Entwicklungszyklen unter Verwendung der Ralph-Wiggum-Methode","Implementieren und Verifizieren von Aufgaben basierend auf der Analyse von Rückständen aus `prd.json`","Bestätigen von Aufgaben nach erfolgreicher Verifizierung, den Entwicklungsprozess rationalisierend"],"pt":["Automatizar ciclos de desenvolvimento únicos seguindo a Metodologia Ralph Wiggum","Implementar e verificar tarefas com base na análise de backlog de `prd.json`","Commitar tarefas após verificação bem-sucedida, otimizando o processo de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать единичные циклы разработки, следующие Методологии Ральфа Виггума","Реализовывать и проверять задачи на основе анализа бэклога из `prd.json`","Фиксировать задачи после успешной верификации, оптимизируя процесс разработки"],"ar":["تطبيع دورات تطوير فردية متابعة لمنهجية رالف وِگّوم","تنفيذ و 驗證 المهام بالاعتماد على تحليل الردف من `prd.json`","التزام المهام بعد 驗證 ناجحة، و تطبيق عمليات التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `prd.json` with backlog","Needs `progress.md` to exist","Dependent on `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` for technical stack information"],"zh":["需要`prd.json`的积压","需要`progress.md`存在","依赖于`.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`获取技术栈信息"],"ja":["`prd.json`のバックログが必要","`progress.md`が存在する必要がある","`.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`に依存して技術スタック情報を取得する"],"ko":["`prd.json`의 백로그가 필요합니다","`progress.md`가 존재해야 합니다","`.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md`에 의존하여 기술 스택 정보를 얻습니다"],"es":["Requiere `prd.json` con atrasos","Necesita que exista `progress.md`","Depende de `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` para obtener información sobre la pila técnica"],"fr":["Nécessite `prd.json` avec des retards","A besoin que `progress.md` existe","Dépend de `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` pour obtenir des informations sur la pile technique"],"de":["Benötigt `prd.json` mit Rückständen","Benötigt die Existenz von `progress.md`","Hängt von `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` ab, um Informationen über den Technik-Stack zu erhalten"],"pt":["Requer `prd.json` com backlog","Precisa que `progress.md` exista","Dependente de `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` para informações de pilha técnica"],"ru":["Требует `prd.json` с бэклогом","Требует существования `progress.md`","Зависит 