Compatibilidad con Vite plugin, PostCSS y CLI","Enfoque de CSS-first para la escritura y migración de estilos","Priorización de reglas según el impacto para la refactorización y generación de código automatizadas"],"fr":["42 règles pour la refactoring et la génération de code automatisées","Optimisation de la taille du paquet CSS et des performances de compilation","Compatibilité avec Vite plugin, PostCSS et CLI","Approche de CSS-first pour l''écriture et la migration de styles","Priorisation des règles selon l''impact pour la refactoring et la génération de code automatisées"],"de":["42 Regeln für die automatisierte Refactoring und Codegenerierung","Optimierung der Größe des CSS-Pakets und der Kompilierungsleistung","Kompatibilität mit Vite-Plugin, PostCSS und CLI","CSS-first-Ansatz für die Erstellung und Migration von Stilen","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung für die automatisierte Refactoring und Codegenerierung"],"pt":["Configuração do Vite plugin","Otimização do tamanho do bundle CSS","Melhores práticas para escrita de estilos com CSS-first","Guia de desempenho para aplicativos React","Automatização de refatoração e geração de código"],"ru":["Настройка плагина Vite","Оптимизация размера пакета CSS","Лучшие практики для написания стилей с помощью CSS-first","Руководство по производительности для приложений React и ИИ Агентов","Автоматизация рефакторинга и генерации кода"],"ar":["إعداد ملحق Vite","تحسين حجم حزمة CSS","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة الأسلوب باستخدام CSS-first","دليل الأداء لتطبيقات React وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تأتميم إعادة هيكلة وتوليد الكود"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tailwind css","tailwind css v4 best practices","tailwind alternative","tailwind vs bootstrap","tailwind install guide","tailwind setup for react","tailwind performance optimization","tailwind css tutorial","what is tailwind css","tailwind labs"],"zh":["Tailwind CSS v4","最佳实践配置","性能优化","代码质量","Vite 插件","PostCSS","CLI","CSS-first"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4","ベストプラクティス設定","パフォーマンス最適化","コード品質","Vite プラグイン","PostCSS","CLI","CSS-first","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4","최적화 설정","성능 향상","코드 품질","Vite 플러그인","PostCSS","CLI","CSS-first","AI 도구"],"es":["Tailwind CSS v4","optimización de rendimiento","react","refactorización automática","generación de código","Vite plugin","PostCSS","CLI","CSS-first","agente de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS v4","optimisation des performances","react","refactoring automatisé","génération de code","Vite plugin","PostCSS","CLI","CSS-first","agent d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Tailwind CSS v4","Leistungsoptimierung","react","automatisierte Refactoring","Codegenerierung","Vite-Plugin","PostCSS","CLI","CSS-first","KI-Agent"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS v4","React","CSS-first","Otimização de desempenho","Configuração do Vite plugin","Melhores práticas para desenvolvedores React","Guia de desempenho para aplicativos React","Automatização de refatoração e geração de código"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS v4","React","CSS-first","Оптимизация производительности","Настройка плагина Vite","Лучшие практики для разработчиков React и ИИ Агентов","Руководство по производительности для приложений React","Автоматизация рефакторинга и генерации кода"],"ar":["Tailwind CSS v4","React","CSS-first","تحسين الأداء","إعداد ملحق Vite","أفضل الممارسات للمطورين React وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل الأداء لتطبيقات React","تأتميم إعادة هيكلة وتوليد الكود"]}},"owner":"thongdn-it","repo":"react-agent-skills","repoPath":"thongdn-it/react-agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.655Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind","description":"Tailwind CSS v4 performance optimization and best practices guidelines (formerly tailwindcss-v4-style). This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring Tailwind CSS v4 code to ensure optimal build performance, minimal CSS output, and correct usage of v4 features. Triggers on tasks involving Tailwind configuration, @theme directive, utility classes, responsive design, dark mode, container queries, or CSS generation optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind Labs Tailwind CSS v4 Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Tailwind CSS v4 applications, maintained by Tailwind Labs. Contains 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Configuring Tailwind CSS v4 build tooling (Vite plugin, PostCSS, CLI)\n- Writing or migrating styles using v4''s CSS-first approach\n- Optimizing CSS bundle size and build performa","body":"# Tailwind Labs Tailwind CSS v4 Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Tailwind CSS v4 applications, maintained by Tailwind Labs. Contains 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Configuring Tailwind CSS v4 build tooling (Vite plugin, PostCSS, CLI)\n- Writing or migrating styles using v4''s CSS-first approach\n- Optimizing CSS bundle size and build performance\n- Implementing responsive designs with breakpoints or container queries\n- Setting up theming with @theme directive and design tokens\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Build Configuration | CRITICAL | `build-` |\n| 2 | CSS Generation | CRITICAL | `gen-` |\n| 3 | Bundle Optimization | HIGH | `bundle-` |\n| 4 | Utility Patterns | HIGH | `util-` |\n| 5 | Component Architecture | MEDIUM-HIGH | `comp-` |\n| 6 | Theming & Design Tokens | MEDIUM | `theme-` |\n| 7 | Responsive & Adaptive | MEDIUM | `resp-` |\n| 8 | Animation & Transitions | LOW-MEDIUM | `anim-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Build Configuration (CRITICAL)\n\n- [`build-vite-plugin`](references/build-vite-plugin.md) - Use Vite Plugin Over PostCSS\n- [`build-css-import`](references/build-css-import.md) - Use CSS Import Over @tailwind Directives\n- [`build-content-detection`](references/build-content-detection.md) - Leverage Automatic Content Detection\n- [`build-node-version`](references/build-node-version.md) - Use Node.js 20+ for Optimal Performance\n- [`build-postcss-simplify`](references/build-postcss-simplify.md) - Remove Redundant PostCSS Plugins\n- [`build-cli-package`](references/build-cli-package.md) - Use Correct CLI Package\n\n### 2. CSS Generation (CRITICAL)\n\n- [`gen-css-first-config`](references/gen-css-first-config.md) - Use CSS-First Configuration Over JavaScript\n- [`gen-avoid-theme-bloat`](references/gen-avoid-theme-bloat.md) - Avoid Excessive Theme Variables\n- [`gen-oklch-colors`](references/gen-oklch-colors.md) - Use OKLCH Color Space for Vivid Colors\n- [`gen-utility-directive`](references/gen-utility-directive.md) - Use @utility for Custom Utilities\n- [`gen-dynamic-utilities`](references/gen-dynamic-utilities.md) - Use Dynamic Utility Values\n- [`gen-css-variable-syntax`](references/gen-css-variable-syntax.md) - Use Parentheses for CSS Variable References\n\n### 3. Bundle Optimization (HIGH)\n\n- [`bundle-remove-unused-plugins`](references/bundle-remove-unused-plugins.md) - Remove Built-in Plugins\n- [`bundle-avoid-preprocessors`](references/bundle-avoid-preprocessors.md) - Avoid Sass/Less Preprocessors\n- [`bundle-css-minification`](references/bundle-css-minification.md) - Enable CSS Minification in Production\n- [`bundle-avoid-cdn-production`](references/bundle-avoid-cdn-production.md) - Avoid Play CDN in Production\n- [`bundle-split-critical-css`](references/bundle-split-critical-css.md) - Extract Critical CSS for Initial Render\n\n### 4. Utility Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- [`util-renamed-utilities`](references/util-renamed-utilities.md) - Use Renamed Utility Classes\n- [`util-important-modifier`](references/util-important-modifier.md) - Use Trailing Important Modifier\n- [`util-variant-stacking`](references/util-variant-stacking.md) - Use Left-to-Right Variant Stacking\n- [`util-explicit-colors`](references/util-explicit-colors.md) - Use Explicit Border and Ring Colors\n- [`util-opacity-modifier`](references/util-opacity-modifier.md) - Use Slash Opacity Modifier\n- [`util-gradient-via-none`](references/util-gradient-via-none.md) - Use via-none to Reset Gradient Stops\n\n### 5. Component Architecture (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- [`comp-avoid-apply-overuse`](references/comp-avoid-apply-overuse.md) - Avoid Overusing @apply\n- [`comp-reference-directive`](references/comp-reference-directive.md) - Use @reference for CSS Module Integration\n- [`comp-utility-file-scope`](references/comp-utility-file-scope.md) - Understand Utility File Scope\n- [`comp-smart-sorting`](references/comp-smart-sorting.md) - Leverage Smart Utility Sorting\n- [`comp-container-customize`](references/comp-container-customize.md) - Customize Container with @utility\n\n### 6. Theming & Design Tokens (MEDIUM)\n\n- [`theme-semantic-tokens`](references/theme-semantic-tokens.md) - Use Semantic Design Token Names\n- [`theme-dark-mode-class`](references/theme-dark-mode-class.md) - Use Class-Based Dark Mode for Control\n- [`theme-prefix-variables`](references/theme-prefix-variables.md) - Use Prefix for Variable Namespacing\n- [`theme-runtime-variables`](references/theme-runtime-variables.md) - Leverage Runtime CSS Variables\n- [`theme-color-scheme`](references/theme-color-scheme.md) - Set color-scheme for Native Dark Mode\n\n### 7. Responsive & Adaptive (MEDIUM)\n\n- [`resp-mobile-first`](references/resp-mobile-first.md) - Use Mobile-First Responsive Design\n- [`resp-container-queries`](references/resp-container-queries.md) - Use Container Queries for Component-Level Responsiveness\n- [`resp-custom-breakpoints`](references/resp-custom-breakpoints.md) - Define Custom Breakpoints in @theme\n- [`resp-hover-capability`](references/resp-hover-capability.md) - Understand Hover Behavior on Touch Devices\n- [`resp-logical-properties`](references/resp-logical-properties.md) - Use Logical Properties for RTL Support\n\n### 8. Animation & Transitions (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- [`anim-gpu-accelerated`](references/anim-gpu-accelerated.md) - Use GPU-Accelerated Transform Properties\n- [`anim-starting-style`](references/anim-starting-style.md) - Use @starting-style for Entry Animations\n- [`anim-gradient-interpolation`](references/anim-gradient-interpolation.md) - Use OKLCH Gradient Interpolation\n- [`anim-3d-transforms`](references/anim-3d-transforms.md) - Use Built-in 3D Transform Utilities\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual reference files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [Section definitions](references/_sections.md) - Category structure and impact levels\n- [Rule template](assets/templates/_template.md) - Template for adding new rules\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor a complete guide with all rules expanded, see [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) | Complete compiled guide with all rules |\n| [references/_sections.md](references/_sections.md) | Category definitions and ordering |\n| [assets/templates/_template.md](assets/templates/_template.md) | Template for new rules |\n| [metadata.json](metadata.json) | Version and reference information |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:57.703Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized CSS performance in Tailwind CSS v4 applications","zh":"非常适合需要在Tailwind CSS v4应用中优化CSS性能的前端代理","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4アプリケーションで最適化されたCSSパフォーマンスが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4 애플리케이션에서 최적화된 CSS 성능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento de CSS optimizado en aplicaciones de Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des performances de CSS optimisées dans les applications Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes CSS-Verhalten in Tailwind CSS v4-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de desempenho de CSS otimizado em aplicações Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется оптимизированное производительность CSS в приложениях Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء CSS محسّن في تطبيقات Tailwind CSS v4"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation using 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, leveraging Vite plugin, PostCSS, and CLI for optimized CSS bundle size and build performance","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，使用42条规则跨8个类别，根据影响优先，利用Vite插件、PostCSS和CLI实现优化的CSS包大小和构建性能","ja":"エージェントに自動化されたリファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、8つのカテゴリにわたる42のルールを使用し、影響に基づいて優先順位を付け、Viteプラグイン、PostCSS、CLIを利用して最適化されたCSSバンドルサイズとビルドパフォーマンスを実現","ko":"에이전트가 자동화된 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 8개 범주에 걸쳐 42개의 규칙을 사용하여 영향을 기준으로 우선순위를 지정하며, Vite 플러그인, PostCSS, CLI를 활용하여 최적화된 CSS 번들 크기 및 빌드 성능을 달성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código utilizando 42 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, aprovechando el complemento Vite, PostCSS y CLI para un tamaño de paquete de CSS optimizado y un rendimiento de compilación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code en utilisant 42 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, en exploitant le plugin Vite, PostCSS et CLI pour une taille de bundle de CSS optimisée et des performances de build","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung zu automatisieren, indem sie 42 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwenden, priorisiert nach Auswirkungen, und dabei das Vite-Plugin, PostCSS und CLI für ein optimiertes CSS-Bundle-Größe und Build-Performance nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e geração de código usando 42 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, aproveitando o plugin Vite, PostCSS e CLI para tamanho de pacote de CSS otimizado e desempenho de compilação","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода, используя 42 правила в 8 категориях, отсортированные по влиянию, используя плагин Vite, PostCSS и CLI для оптимизированного размера пакета CSS и производительности сборки","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تutomation إعادة هيكلة وإنشاء التعليمات البرمجية باستخدام 42 قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب التأثير، باستخدام إضافة Vite و PostCSS و CLI للحصول على حجم حزمة CSS محسّن وأداء إنشاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Tailwind CSS v4 build tooling for optimal performance","Writing or migrating styles using v4''s CSS-first approach","Optimizing CSS bundle size and build performance"],"zh":["为Tailwind CSS v4配置最优性能的构建工具","使用v4的CSS优先方法编写或迁移样式","优化CSS包大小和构建性能"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4のビルドツールを最適なパフォーマンスに設定する","v4のCSS優先アプローチを使用してスタイルを書き込むまたは移行する","CSSバンドルサイズとビルドパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4를 위한 최적의 성능을 가진 빌드 도구 구성","v4의 CSS 우선 접근 방식을 사용하여 스타일을 작성하거나 마이그레이션","CSS 번들 크기 및 빌드 성능 최적화"],"es":["Configuración de la herramienta de compilación de Tailwind CSS v4 para un rendimiento óptimo","Escritura o migración de estilos utilizando el enfoque de CSS primero de v4","Optimización del tamaño del paquete de CSS y el rendimiento de compilación"],"fr":["Configuration de l''outil de build de Tailwind CSS v4 pour des performances optimales","Écriture ou migration de styles en utilisant l''approche CSS première de v4","Optimisation de la taille du bundle de CSS et des performances de build"],"de":["Konfiguration des Build-Tools von Tailwind CSS v4 für optimale Leistung","Schreiben oder Migration von Styles unter Verwendung des CSS-erst-Ansatzes von v4","Optimierung der CSS-Bundle-Größe und der Build-Leistung"],"pt":["Configurando a ferramenta de compilação do Tailwind CSS v4 para desempenho ótimo","Escrevendo ou migrando estilos usando a abordagem CSS-first do v4","Otimizando o tamanho da bundle de CSS e o desempenho de compilação"],"ru":["Настройка инструмента сборки Tailwind CSS v4 для оптимальной производительности","Написание или перенос стилей, используя подход CSS-first версии 4","Оптимизация размера пакета CSS и производительности сборки"],"ar":["تكوين أداة الترجمة Tailwind CSS v4 للأداء الأمثل","كتابة أو نقل الأنماط باستخدام نهج CSS-الأول v4","تحسين حجم حزمة CSS وأداء الترجمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Tailwind CSS v4","Requires configuration of build tooling like Vite plugin, PostCSS, or CLI"],"zh":["特定于Tailwind CSS v4","需要配置诸如Vite插件、PostCSS或CLI的构建工具"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4に特有の","Viteプラグイン、PostCSS、またはCLIなどのビルドツールを設定する必要がある"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4에 특정","Vite 플러그인, PostCSS 또는 CLI와 같은 빌드 도구를 구성해야 함"],"es":["Específico de Tailwind CSS v4","Requiere la configuración de herramientas de compilación como el complemento Vite, PostCSS o CLI"],"fr":["Spécifique à Tailwind CSS v4","Nécessite la configuration d''outils de build tels que le plugin Vite, PostCSS ou CLI"],"de":["Spezifisch für Tailwind CSS v4","Erfordert die Konfiguration von Build-Tools wie Vite-Plugin, PostCSS oder CLI"],"pt":["Específico para o Tailwind CSS v4","Exige configuração de ferramentas de compilação como plugin Vite, PostCSS ou CLI"],"ru":["Конкретно для Tailwind CSS v4","Требует настройки инструментов сборки, таких как плагин Vite, PostCSS или CLI"],"ar":["محدد لبرنامج Tailwind CSS v4","يتطلب تكوين أدوات الترجمة مثل إضافة Vite و PostCSS و CLI"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ba473b96fa12e924c6387a037a1c58dcd7f7619ff4119fd247fc858b67d04ec0","qualityScore":26}');
