INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('JDenn0514/surveycore/cran', 'cran', 'JDenn0514', 'surveycore', 'community', 'cran JDenn0514 surveycore community data r resear survey-analysis cran provides core survey analysis infrastructure, benefiting researchers and developers working with R and survey analysis. It streamlines projects with defined rules and checks. CRAN 提交指南为 Surveyverse 项目提供了 R CMD check 和 devtools::check() 的最佳实践 CRAN 提交ガイドは、Surveyverse プロジェクトの R CMD check と devtools::check() のベストプラクティスを提供する CRAN 제출 가이드는 Surveyverse 프로젝트의 R CMD check 및 devtools::check() 최적화 방법을 제공합니다 CRAN es una infraestructura central para el análisis de encuestas, que utiliza R y devtools para garantizar la calidad de los paquetes CRAN est une infrastructure centrale pour l''analyse d''enquêtes, qui utilise R et devtools pour assurer la qualité des packages CRAN ist eine zentrale Infrastruktur für die Umfrageanalyse, die R und devtools verwendet, um die Qualität der Pakete zu gewährleisten O CRAN é uma infraestrutura de análise de pesquisas que utiliza o R e o devtools para análise de dados. Aprenda a configurá-lo com nossa guia CRAN - это инфраструктура анализа опросов, которая использует R и devtools для анализа данных. Узнайте, как ее настроить с нашей помощью أداة CRAN هي بنية تحتية لتحليل الاستطلاعات التي تستخدم R و devtools لتحليل البيانات. تعلم كيفية إعدادها مع دليلنا how to use cran for survey analysis cran vs other survey analysis tools cran install guide for R what is cran in R programming cran alternative for data analysis cran setup guide for AI agents cran tutorial for researchers cran best practices for survey analysis CRAN 提交指南 Surveyverse 项目 R CMD check devtools::check() r 包管理 调查分析基础设施 AI 工具 R 语言 数据分析 Utilizes R CMD check for targeted error and warning detection Employs devtools::check() for cadence and pre-approved notes management References r-package-conventions.md for standardized project structure Supports preflight-checklist.md for thorough project preparation Enforces rules for Surveyverse projects, including ≤2 notes and 0 errors cran is a core survey analysis infrastructure that provides a set of rules and checks for R packages, ensuring seamless project execution and high-quality results.');
